<ProjectLayout slug="cat-ii">
  <p>
    <em>CAT II</em> is an animated work created for the large-scale LED wall
    at Cologne Bonn Airport.
  </p>

  <p>
    The work follows an aircraft moving through memory, departure and return,
    combining hand-drawn animation with the architecture of the airport.
  </p>

  <img
    class="project-image"
    src="/images/cat-ii/01.webp"
    alt="CAT II installation at Cologne Bonn Airport"
    data-caption="CAT II, Cologne Bonn Airport, 2026"
  />

